  triage:description "tests.rs:307 windows_local_ipc_runtime_terminate_finishes_within_deadline asserts shutdown_started.elapsed() < Duration::from_secs(5). Wall-clock assertion flaky under CI load on Windows runner. Fix: replace with structural correctness check or raise threshold to 30s annotated as regression guard only." ;
